# CQ23 [Actors & operations] Which actors are involved in operating the platform and which roles do they play?
PREFIX optimar: <https://w3id.org/optimar#>
PREFIX sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/>
PREFIX qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
SELECT ?actor ?actorType ?role ?roleType WHERE {
  ?actor a ?actorType . ?actorType rdfs:subClassOf optimar:Actor .
  OPTIONAL { ?actor optimar:hasRole ?role . ?role a ?roleType . ?roleType rdfs:subClassOf optimar:Role }
}
